{
  "name": "brand_add_assets",
  "description": "Collect a brand's assets while reading it: each an address on the site (url) or a pod file (path), with where it was found. Downloads and keeps each, and asks what each is (logo, icon, photo, illustration, other) and whether it is the brand's own. resort asks again about assets already collected.",
